      "phone": "+918871025411",
      "source": "Application",
      "notes": "Application: Senior Academics Manager – Srikesh Iyer (M.Tech Robotics, 5+ Yrs K-12 EdTech)\r\n​Hi!\r\n​I am applying for the Senior Academics Manager position. With an M.Tech in Robotics from IIT Gandhinagar and 5+ years driving K–12 EdTech operations, my background perfectly bridges deep STEM expertise with scalable curriculum execution.\r\n​I am a strong fit for this role because I bring:\r\n​Robotics & STEM Pedagogy: My foundation in experiential, inquiry-based STEM was built at IITGN—working hands-on with the Creative Learning Initiative (CLI) and Nyasa—and through my IEEE/Neurorobotics publications.\r\n​Pedagogical Rigor: I hold a B.Ed. and am CTET-qualified, ensuring my curriculum frameworks strictly adhere to cognitive load balance and national academic standards.\r\n​Curriculum & Delivery at Scale: I have overseen the end-to-end design of 4,500+ K–12 content decks and 100+ chapters.\r\n​Teacher Training & Implementation: I have designed training for and managed 80+ mentors/Master Teachers, and successfully implemented programs across 15+ partner schools (MOUs).\r\n​I would love to bring my technical background and systems-driven approach to your academic team.\r\n​Best regards,\r\n​Srikesh Iyer",
